# Exclude everything, then re-include exactly what the build needs.
# Rationale: a deny-list silently grows stale as the repo grows (docs/, logs/,
# .falkordb-data/, ps-skills/, spikes/, test-data/, tools/ all exist today and all
# must stay out); an allow-list can only ever be wrong in the loud direction --
# a missing entry fails the build instead of silently fattening the image.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!ps-service/pyproject.toml
!ps-service/src
!ps-cli/pyproject.toml

# Belt and braces: never let a re-included tree drag these back in.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[codz]
**/.venv
**/tests
